# Production builds target the same-origin /api path; the ingress/nginx in front
# of the static bundle proxies /api to the FastAPI backend (see k8s/ + deploy/).
# This is the sane production default; the deploy image can still override it via
# the VITE_API_BASE build-arg (deploy/docker/frontend.Dockerfile).
#
# Keeping the base same-origin also means the wired auth calls issue no CORS
# preflight, so the Playwright e2e (which builds + previews this bundle) can
# intercept /auth/* with page.route.
VITE_API_BASE=/api
